om, along with three bedrooms and two  bathrooms. The fully developed basement provides even more living space with two additional bedrooms, a full bathroom, and a cozy family room, making this an ideal home for a growing family. Numerous renovations and improvements have been completed over the years, including windows, roof, shed shingles, bathrooms, carpet, electrical panel, fencing, a beautiful kitchen remodel, hot water tank, play house , and much more. The carpets have been cleaned and the furnace has been inspected and cleaned, so the home is ready for its new family. Ideally located close to schools, shopping, public transportation and parks ! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$525,000"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","5"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","1,544 sq ft"],["Year built","1976"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Baturyn"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5X2N8"],["MLS® number","E4508070"],["Listed","September 11, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Dishwasher, Wine Fridge, Stove, Dryer, Microwave, Freezer, Oven - Built-In, Hood Fan, See remarks, Storage Shed, Two Refrigerators"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"],["Community","Public Swimming Pool"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.08 m × 4.83 m (13'5\" × 15'10\")"],["Dining room","Main level","4.08 m × 3.79 m (13'5\" × 12'5\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.10 m × 5.50 m (13'5\" × 18'1\")"],["Family room","Main level","4.10 m × 3.61 m (13'5\" × 11'10\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","4.13 m × 3.97 m (13'7\" × 13'0\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.08 m × 3.99 m (10'1\" × 13'1\")"],["Bedroom 3","Main level","3.07 m × 2.91 m (10'1\" × 9'7\")"],["Bedroom 4","Basement","3.65 m × 3.54 m (12'0\" × 11'7\")"],["Bedroom 5","Basement",""],["Storage","Basement","3.88 m × 4.69 m (12'9\" × 15'5\")"]],"courtesy":"Kathy Sobh, MaxWell Polaris","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmon